#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:4
msgid ":index:`How do I change the fonts size or font? <change font size>`"
msgstr ":index:`如何更改字体大小或字体? <change font size>`"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:7
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:9
msgid "Picard is a Qt application, so whatever works for other Qt application will work for Picard."
msgstr ""
"Picard 是一个 Qt 应用程序，因此其他 Qt 应用程序适用的任何方法都适用于 Picard"
"。"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:12
msgid "Linux specific"
msgstr "Linux 特定"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:14
msgid "Two ways to change the size/scaling are:"
msgstr "更改大小/缩放的两种方法是："

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:16
msgid "**Desktop Settings**"
msgstr "**桌面设置**"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:0
msgid "The usual default way to change the scaling is to rely on the settings of the desktop environment, e.g. on GNOME the scaling set when configuring the screens. This usually works, and should be the first approach to take."
msgstr ""
"更改缩量的常用默认方法依赖于桌面环境的设置，例如在 GNOME 中配置屏幕时设置的缩"
"放。这通常有效，并且应该是首先尝试的方法。"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:20
msgid "**Environment Settings**"
msgstr "**环境设置**"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:0
msgid "Setting the environment variable ``QT_SCALE_FACTOR`` will scale fonts for Qt applications. This can be useful on 4k monitors. From a terminal, you can then run ``QT_SCALE_FACTOR=2.0 picard`` to start Picard, or create an alias in your shell, or set the variable in your shell to affect all Qt applications."
msgstr ""
"设置环境变量 ``QT_SCALE_FACTOR`` 将为 Qt 应用程序缩放字体。这在 4k 显示器上很"
"有用。然后，您可以从终端运行 ``QT_SCALE_FACTOR=2.0 picard`` 来启动 Picard，或"
"在您的 shell 中创建一个别名，或在您的 shell 中设置该变量以影响所有 Qt 应用程"
"序。"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:24
msgid "To change both the size/scaling and the font, use `qt6ct <https://github.com/trialuser02/qt6ct>`_ to set the new font and/or size. Note that these changes will apply to all Qt applications, not just Picard."
msgstr ""
"要更改大小/缩放和字体，请使用 `qt6ct <https://github.com/trialuser02/qt6ct>"
"`_ 设置新字体和/或大小。请注意，这些更改将适用于所有 Qt 应用程序，而不仅仅是 "
"Picard。"

#: ../../faq/faq_font_size.rst:26
msgid "`The official documentation on high DPI <https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/highdpi.html>`_ could be a useful read as well."
msgstr ""
"`有关高 DPI 的官方文档 <https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/highdpi.html>`_ 也可能是一个有"
"用的阅读材料。"
